WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:03,000
These are not official betrothal gifts.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,560
Just count me coming to express my gratitude today

3
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:07,830
The house is not completely built yet

4
00:00:07,830 --> 00:00:09,430
I can't wrong Xiao Xi

5
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:11,590
Waiting for the new house to cool down

6
00:00:11,590 --> 00:00:13,030
I asked Captain Wang to make coal

7
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:14,830
Ask the village elders to testify

8
00:00:14,830 --> 00:00:18,460
Officially engaged to A Tian

9
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:22,100
My family is too poor to afford a decent dowry Shen Zi

10
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:23,420
I married Xiao Xi

11
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:27,210
Not a dowry

12
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:29,170
The most difficult time for me before

13
00:00:29,170 --> 00:00:31,540
It was Xiao Xi who secretly gave me steamed buns

14
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:34,070
give me eggs

15
00:00:34,070 --> 00:00:36,150
