16
00:00:37,170 --> 00:00:40,780
It's a good way to survive

17
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:42,100
Shen Zi agreed

18
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:45,860
Then can I call brother-in-law Xiao Shen every day from now on?

19
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:47,610
Don't talk nonsense

20
00:00:47,610 --> 00:00:48,920
Don't talk nonsense

21
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:49,960
Shouting first

22
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:53,780
From now on, please take care of your brother-in-law's anger.

23
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:55,580
You two go to the courtyard to talk.
